        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-yap-excitable-segmentation-audit-v2-hubaud-yap-excitable-segmentation-5> ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Excitable FitzHugh-Nagumo Somite Clock Gated by YAP Mechanotransduction" ;
